CREATED:20260814T185459Z
DESCRIPTION:On Oct. 1 Duke kicks off Cybersecurity Awareness Month with th
 e annual Cyber Bowl\, a month-long quiz competition\, Oct. 1-31\, that te
 sts your cyber skills and knowledge. Everyone at Duke can play.\n\nPlay t
 he Cyber Bowl by logging into duke.is/CyberBowl2026 with your Duke NetID 
 and taking a short quiz on topics such as passwords\, phishing\, malware 
 and online privacy. \n\nLearn more about Cybersecurity Awareness Month at
  Duke: security.duke.edu/secure/news/cybersecurity-awareness-month-2026.\
 n\nEarn points and help Duke win!
