CREATED:20260714T174042Z
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Family Weekend with an unforgettable showcase featur
 ing three of Duke Music's premier student ensembles: the Duke Chorale\, D
 uke Symphony Orchestra\, and Duke University Wind Symphony.\n\nThe Duke C
 horale explores the universal experiences of birth\, death\, and love thr
 ough music from Mexico\, Finland\, Spain\, and the United States. The Duk
 e Symphony Orchestra brings the brilliance and expressive power of Mendel
 ssohn to the stage\, while the Duke University Wind Symphony rounds out t
 he program with a dynamic performance of its own.\n\nBringing together vo
 ices\, strings\, winds\, brass\, and percussion\, this annual concert off
 ers families a vibrant glimpse into the extraordinary music-making happen
 ing at Duke.\n\nThis event requires tickets which can be purchased at tic
 kets.duke.edu.
DURATION:PT1H
