DESCRIPTION:What happens after we die? What reasons do Christians have for
  hope in the afterlife? What does the Bible teach about our posture now w
 hile we are among the living?\n\nThe Congregation's weekly Adult Forum of
 fers a variety of guest speakers\, presentations and discussions on a wid
 e range of thought-provoking topics\, including Biblical studies\, curren
 t social issues and the work of mission agencies.  Adult Forum aims to de
 epen the faith and understanding of adults through shared learning experi
 ences. Classes include programs and discussions on contemporary issues in
  light of Christian teachings.
DURATION:PT1H
