DESCRIPTION:Students and their families are invited to join Jewish Life at
  Duke for a delicious bagel brunch. Visit the Freeman Center for Jewish L
 ife\, the home of Jewish Life at Duke and the Rubenstein-Silvers Hillel\,
  meet fellow families and the JLD staff\, and nosh on a kosher brunch as 
 you wrap up your visit to Duke. The event is FREE for students and $12 fo
 r non-students. Hosted by Jewish Life at Duke. All are welcome.\n\nPlease
  register by completing the Family Weekend online registration form at ht
 tps://students.duke.edu/info-for/families/family-weekend/
