DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in learning more about the Congregation at 
 Duke University Chapel-or considering making the Congregation your church
  home?\n\nJoin us this fall for Exploring Membership\, a three-session op
 portunity to get to know one another\, learn more about the Congregation 
 and our relationship with Duke Chapel\, explore the faith and practices t
 hat shape our life together\, and consider what it means to belong and pa
 rticipate in this community.\n\nOn October 25\, rather than meeting for c
 lass\, participants are invited to experience the life of the Congregatio
 n with fresh attention. Those who choose to become members will be welcom
 ed into the Congregation during worship on Sunday\, November 8.\n\nWhethe
 r you are ready to become a member or simply curious to learn more\, you 
 are welcome. Participating does not obligate you to join.\n\nRegister Her
 e for Exploring Membership:\nhttps://congregationatdukechapel.breezechms.
 com/form/9635dd
DURATION:PT1H
