DESCRIPTION:For centuries\, the church has marked the transition from dayt
 ime to evening with psalms\, prayer\, and song. Duke Chapel's Choral Even
 song follows this historic pattern\, using the liturgy of the Book of Com
 mon Prayer and featuring choral and organ music from the English cathedra
 l tradition\, led by the Chapel's Evensong Singers.\n\nParking is availab
 le on a first-come-first-served basis in the Bryan Center garage at 125 S
 cience Drive. ADA parking is available in the Bryan Center Surface Lot at
  the same address.\n\nThe service is livestreamed on the Duke Chapel YouT
 ube channel and broadcast live on channel 12 of the Duke Hospital TV syst
 em.
DURATION:PT45M
DTSTAMP:20260814T132940Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261018T160000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260814T132940Z
