CREATED:20260924T154437Z
DESCRIPTION:Jewish Life at Duke presents an evening with journalist and po
 litical analyst Haviv Rettig Gur. Haviv Rettig Gur is an Israeli journali
 st\, host of the "Ask Haviv Anything" podcast\, Middle East analyst at "T
 he Free Press\," and senior analyst at "The Times of Israel."\n \nRettig 
 Gur has covered Israel's politics\, foreign policy\, education system and
  relationship with the Jewish diaspora since 2005\, reported from over 20
  countries\, served as director of communications for the Jewish Agency f
 or Israel\, Israel's largest NGO\, and taught at prestigious pre-military
  academies.\n \nNot open to the general public. This event is ticketed an
 d by-invitation. \n\nTickets are limited. Current students can request a 
 ticket by filling out the following request form: https://duke.is/HRG
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260924T180853Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261018T180000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T180853Z
