DESCRIPTION:The PhD Innovators Program helps develop entrepreneurial skill
 s and mindset around your research and develop a viable path to making im
 pact in the real world. You will learn from experienced professionals fro
 m across the scientific translation ecosystem and make connections that h
 elp move your idea forward. For science to make an impact\, someone needs
  to take it beyond the journal publication. PhD Innovators helps develop 
 and position you to be that person.\n\nApplications due October 19.\n\nQu
 estions? Contact Program Director\, Kelli Luginbuhl\, PhD.
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T000000
