DESCRIPTION:Duke offers locations where faculty\, staff and students can r
 eceive a free flu vaccination. Vaccinations can also be obtained at Duke 
 Primary Care providers\, area pharmacies and other locations\, but docume
 ntation must be provided for compliance.\n\nAnnual vaccination against th
 e flu is a condition of employment at Duke Health\; other University staf
 f and faculty working on-site must be vaccinated or have an approved medi
 cal or religious exemption to maintain access to Duke's buildings and fac
 ilities.\n\nFind out more at vaccines.duke.edu.
DURATION:PT8H
