DESCRIPTION:The Volunteer Fair connects Duke students\, faculty\, staff\, 
 and alumni with a variety of service opportunities in the Triangle area. 
 This annual event has been a cornerstone for fostering relationships betw
 een the Duke community and local nonprofits\, in partnership with the Tri
 angle Nonprofit Volunteer Leadership Center.\n\nRSVPs are encouraged to h
 elp us plan for attendance and refreshments\, but they are entirely optio
 nal. We welcome all members of the Duke community to join us and explore 
 the Volunteer Fair on the day of the event.
DURATION:PT4H
