CREATED:20230805T023014Z
DESCRIPTION:Professor Vingron's research focuses on computational molecula
 r biology\, with major areas of interest including computational regulato
 ry genomics\, particularly the interplay between DNA sequence and epigene
 tic mechanisms in gene regulation. His work also investigates human genom
 ic variation\, such as structural variation\, and its role in genetic dis
 ease through regulatory mechanisms. In addition\, he conducts research in
  transcriptomics and single-cell transcriptomics to better understand gen
 e expression and cellular diversity.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20261012T201900Z
