DESCRIPTION:Presenting your research data in a poster or oral presentation
  is a great way to engage with the research community.  Effective data vi
 sualizations can help audiences quickly grasp key findings\, identify tre
 nds\, and connect with your research. In this interactive workshop\, Dr. 
 Eric Monson will explore best practices for designing clear\, impactful v
 isualizations and discuss how visual storytelling can strengthen your res
 earch presentations. Participants will gain practical tools for communica
 ting data with confidence and clarity.
DURATION:PT1H
