DESCRIPTION:Presentations are a unique opportunity to communicate your res
 earch to a captive audience\, yet few of us receive training on how to fr
 ame our material or design our slides. This workshop will cover practical
  storytelling\, data visualization\, and graphic design techniques that y
 ou can start applying now to better explain your research and motivate yo
 ur audience. This event is open to non-Duke participants.
